{"kind":"event","event":{"kind":"statement-drafted","stepId":"step_321ef1ef9dc816854aa1ba72f7a9f83a","sql":"SELECT d.dept_no, d.dept_name, COUNT(de.emp_no) AS employee_count\nFROM department d\nJOIN dept_emp de ON d.dept_no = de.dept_no\nGROUP BY d.dept_no, d.dept_name\nORDER BY employee_count DESC;","rationale":"Find the department with the most employees (total historical or current? Let's check both or group by dept_no / dept_name using dept_emp). Let's write a query to count employees per department.","atMs":1786552162376}}
